, while Blackburn calls Green a socialist and stresses deportations and school choice, per WSMV and NewsChannel 5.","issues":[{"issue":"Grocery tax and affordability","why":"Green wants to end the state sales tax on groceries and redirect unspent welfare funds to family relief.","src":"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/09/28/democratic-gubernatorial-contender-jerri-green-talks-affordability-republican-supermajority/"},{"issue":"School vouchers and public schools","why":"Blackburn backs school choice while Green says vouchers are failing public school students.","src":"https://www.wsmv.com/2026/08/07/marsha-blackburn-wins-tennessee-gop-gubernatorial-primary/"},{"issue":"Rural hospitals and Medicaid","why":"Green warns of more rural hospital closures and wants Medicaid expansion to cover about 300,000 uninsured Tennesseans.","src":"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/09/28/democratic-gubernatorial-contender-jerri-green-talks-affordability-republican-supermajority/"},{"issue":"Immigration enforcement","why":"Blackburn pledges to deport people here illegally and back ICE, while Green would end Highway Patrol cooperation with ICE.","src":"https://www.wsmv.com/2026/08/07/marsha-blackburn-wins-tennessee-gop-gubernatorial-primary/"},{"issue":"Data centers","why":"Green opposes state incentives for data centers and says Blackburn would favor corporations and billionaires.","src":"https://www.newschannel5.com/plus/inside-politics/election-2026-tn-governors-race-jerri-green"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Green makes her pitch as Blackburn declines","date":"2026-10-16","what":"On NewsChannel 5, Green pitched ending the grocery tax and fully funding schools, and said Blackburn follows Trump uncritically, while Blackburn declined to appear.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://www.newschannel5.com/plus/inside-politics/election-2026-tn-governors-race-jerri-green"},{"title":"Blackburn skips press association forum","date":"2026-10-12","what":"Green and independents Hatley and Pinkston agreed to an Oct. 27 forum at MTSU while Blackburn did not respond, consistent with her no forum strategy as the frontrunner.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.newsfromthestates.com/article/green-hatley-pinkston-participate-tennessee-press-association-governors-forum"},{"title":"Poll shows Blackburn ahead by nine","date":"2026-09-28","what":"A September poll paid for by a pro Green PAC showed Blackburn 45, Green 36 and Hatley 10.","helps":"R","kind":"local","src":"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/09/28/democratic-gubernatorial-contender-jerri-green-talks-affordability-republican-supermajority/"},{"title":"Blackburn camp targets independent Hatley","date":"2026-09-28","what":"Blackburn's campaign funded a website attacking independent David Hatley over a 1998 felony conviction, aiming to keep conservative voters in line.","helps":"R","kind":"attack","src":"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/09/28/democratic-gubernatorial-contender-jerri-green-talks-affordability-republican-supermajority/"},{"title":"Blackburn rejects debates, calls Green socialist","date":"2026-09-08","what":"Green proposed four debates across the state, and Blackburn said she would not give a platform to a socialist candidate.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.wsmv.com/2026/09/08/jerri-green-formally-challenges-marsha-blackburn-series-gubernatorial-debates-ahead-tn-midterms/"},{"title":"Blackburn wins GOP primary","date":"2026-08-06","what":"Blackburn won the Republican nomination after skipping debates with rivals, running ads promising to deport illegal immigrants and stop the flow of drugs.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.wsmv.com/2026/08/07/marsha-blackburn-wins-tennessee-gop-gubernatorial-primary/"}],"events":[{"title":"Debate or not","prompt":"Your opponent has proposed debates in four cities and a statewide press forum is scheduled, but the frontrunner has held no public forums. What do you do?","issue":"other","src":"https://www.wsmv.com/2026/09/08/jerri-green-formally-challenges-marsha-blackburn-series-gubernatorial-debates-ahead-tn-midterms/","opts":[{"label":"Debate every city","say":"Accept all debate dates and challenge your opponent to show up.","pos":-0.4,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"One forum only","say":"Agree to the single statewide press association forum.","pos":0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Refuse, stay on message","say":"Decline and say you will not give a platform to a socialist.","pos":0.7,"trump":0.6,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Grocery tax","prompt":"Grocery costs are a top worry and Tennessee taxes food at the register. Do you cut the grocery tax, and how do you pay for it?","issue":"econ","src":"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/09/28/democratic-gubernatorial-contender-jerri-green-talks-affordability-republican-supermajority/","opts":[{"label":"End it, cut business rebates","say":"Eliminate the grocery tax and end tax rebates for large businesses.","pos":-0.7,"trump":-0.5,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Phase it down","say":"Lower the food tax gradually as the budget allows.","pos":0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Cut taxes across the board","say":"Promise broad tax cuts and less spending rather than a targeted break.","pos":0.7,"trump":0.5,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"ICE cooperation","prompt":"Tennessee Highway Patrol works with ICE on immigration enforcement. Do you keep, expand or end that partnership?","issue":"immig","src":"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/09/28/democratic-gubernatorial-contender-jerri-green-talks-affordability-republican-supermajority/","opts":[{"label":"End the partnership","say":"End Highway Patrol cooperation with ICE and focus troopers on road safety.","pos":-0.8,"trump":-0.9,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Limit to criminals","say":"Cooperate only on people charged with violent crimes.","pos":0,"trump":-0.2,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Expand deportations","say":"Pledge to deport illegal immigrants and stop the flow of drugs and drug money.","p